# SAZ Events - Assets Folder
# This folder contains all media assets for the website

## Required Files (Replace with your own):

### Videos
- hero-video.mp4 - Main hero section background video (1920x1080, compressed)
- video-banner.mp4 - Video banner section background (1920x1080, compressed)

### Audio
- background-music.mp3 - Background music for the website (loop-friendly)

### Images
- favicon.png - Website favicon (32x32 or 64x64)
- logo.png - Company logo (transparent background)

## Recommended Specifications:

### Videos
- Resolution: 1920x1080 (Full HD)
- Format: MP4 (H.264 codec)
- Frame Rate: 30fps
- Bitrate: 5-10 Mbps for good quality/size balance
- Duration: 15-30 seconds (looping)

### Audio
- Format: MP3
- Bitrate: 128-192 kbps
- Duration: 2-3 minutes (seamless loop)
- Sample Rate: 44.1 kHz

### Images
- Favicon: 64x64 PNG with transparency
- Logo: 300x100 PNG with transparency

## Free Resources:

### Stock Videos (Free)
- Pexels: pexels.com
- Pixabay: pixabay.com
- Mixkit: mixkit.co

### Stock Music (Free)
- YouTube Audio Library
- Bensound: bensound.com
- Free Music Archive: freemusicarchive.org

### Stock Images (Free)
- Unsplash: unsplash.com
- Pexels: pexels.com
- Pixabay: pixabay.com

## Optimization Tips:
1. Compress videos using HandBrake or FFmpeg
2. Use WebP format for images where supported
3. Implement lazy loading for images
4. Use CDN for faster delivery
5. Minimize file sizes without compromising quality